# A reflexive triggered ability is part of the ability that makes it trigger (CR 603.12), whose text was fixed as it was
# activated (CR 602.2, 113.7a). Bot1 activates Minsc & Boo's -2 sacrificing Boo, a Hamster; in response Artificial Evolution
# replaces Hamster with Elf in Minsc & Boo's text. The -2 resolves with its own text, and so does the reflexive trigger it
# makes: "if the sacrificed creature was a Hamster, draw X cards" asks of a Hamster, so Bot1 draws (Boo has power 1).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Minsc & Boo, Timeless Heroes
Mox Sapphire
Artificial Evolution
Mountain x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

